    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="X67n1299-start">
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a0601.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Om Mani Dak Hei Hou Hei Su Lu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a0601.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The Spring of Buddha Wisdom says.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a0601.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">One speck in the eye, countless blossoms fall in disorder.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a0601.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">On a narrow road, meeting is hard to avoid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a0601.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Great King, do you still recognize this old monk?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a0601.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Snow-like eyebrows long and sweeping the ground.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1201.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The king of East India invited Venerable Prajñātara for a vegetarian meal.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1201.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The king then asked.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1201.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Everyone is reciting scriptures.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1201.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Why is the master the only one not reciting?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1201.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The master said.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1201.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">This poor monk's outgoing breath does not involve any external conditions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1201.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The incoming breath does not abide within the realms of the senses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1201.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Constantly reciting such scriptures.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1201.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Hundreds of thousands of millions of volumes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1501.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Fényáng Zhāo said.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1501.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">It troubles the Venerable's heart and strength.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Tiāntóng Jué's verse says.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The cloud rhinoceros plays with the moon, gleaming bright.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The wooden horse roams in spring, a fine steed unrestrained.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Beneath the brows, a pair of cold, emerald eyes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">How can one read scriptures and pierce the ox hide?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Understanding the mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Surpasses countless eons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Heroic strength.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Breaks through heavy encirclement.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Wondrous and perfect pivot, the mouth turns the spiritual mechanism.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Hánshān forgets the road he came by.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Shíde will lead and take your hand to return.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Xī Chán Xū says.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The incoming breath has never resided in the realm of the senses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The outgoing breath has never involved myriad conditions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">One sound of a fisherman's flute leaves the southern shore.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a1601.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Still sleeping deep within the reeds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a2201.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The king of Kashmir, holding a sword, asked Venerable Lion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a2201.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">Has the master attained the emptiness of the aggregates?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a2201.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The master said: I have already attained the emptiness of the aggregates.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#X67n1299_CBETA_001-0002a2201.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:46:54.453+09:00">The king said.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
